  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDM Short-Term Investment Project: CTM Substation Upgrade</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short Term Investment Programme supports the upgarde of transmission infrastructure in Mozambique to alleciate suppply contrants and improve secrurity and quality of electricity supply. The programme is supported together with KFW and EIB. This particular programme  will support the upgrade of the CTM substation which is vital for security of supply, and production, in the Maputo area.</narrative>
  </description>
